  "kind": "주관식",
  "body": "$\\left(\\dfrac{1-i}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)^6$을 계산하시오.",
  "choices": [],
  "answer": "$i$",
  "figure": null,
  "choicesFigure": null,
  "solution": "$\\left(\\dfrac{1-i}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)^2=\\dfrac{1-2i+i^2}{2}=\\dfrac{-2i}{2}=-i$이므로\n$\\left(\\dfrac{1-i}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)^6=\\left\\{\\left(\\dfrac{1-i}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)^2\\right\\}^3=(-i)^3=-i^3$\n$=-(-i)=i$",
  "parent": ""
 },
